+# ---- NVFP4 cache format (E2M1 + E4M3 block-16 scales, 4.5 bits/elem) ----------------------
+# Codes: [sign | 2 exp | 1 mantissa]; magnitudes by idx: 0, 0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, 3, 4, 6.
+# Packed two per uint8 byte, low nibble = even element. One E4M3 scale per 16 elements.
